{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"fbbc053acfa03066",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Things We need for smooth migration \n- Objects\n\t- Core Objects v 1\n\t- Custom objects v 2\n- Relationships \n\t- Data model how each objects are connected v 1\n- Properties a.k.a Fields \n\t- Types v 1\n\t\t- with all Drop-downs v 1\n\t- Formula Fields \n- Activities \n\t- Emails \n\t- calls \n\t- Notes \n\t- meetings \n\t- Tasks \n- Files \n\t- Attachments \n\t- docs \n\t- images \n\t- pdf\n\t- contracts \n- Pipelines \n\t- Stages \n\t- Pipelines \n- Users \n\t- Users \n\t- Teams \n\t- Roles \n\t- Permissions\n\t- Ownership \n- Workflows \n- Lists \n- Views \n- Reports and dashboard \n- Sequences ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-680,
			"y":-560,
			"width":680,
			"height":520
		},
		{
			"id":"ac4a94806d7a3585",
