		},
		{
			"id":"c838e15fdfaf57c8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Understand ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-700,
			"y":60,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"f9b99ac5770f9bd0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"==JTBD== for this step \n- As a Super Admin in SparrowCRM, I connect my HubSpot with OAuth alone — no API key, no third-party account, no copy-pasting tokens.\n- As a Super Admin in SparrowCRM, I pick which HubSpot portal to migrate from (HubSpot's native account picker) and see SparrowCRM confirm exactly which one it got — name, Hub ID, tier.\n- As a Super Admin in SparrowCRM, I am certain this cannot touch my HubSpot data — read-only, zero write scopes, disconnect at any time.\n- As a Super Admin in SparrowCRM, I know before the OAuth jump that I need HubSpot Super Admin, and if I'm not one, I get a link I can send to whoever is.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1530,
			"y":480,
			"width":580,
			"height":500
		},
		{
			"id":"0e66a1737e4fde38",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Migrate",
			"styleAttributes":{},
